{
  "title": "Kicked Spicy Jamaican Romano Pepper Skewers",
  "description": "A jammy, snappy, festive Jamaican dish featuring Romano pepper and ferment-kimchi, perfect for a gluten-free friendly meal. This dish is full of flavor and spice.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
